- A variable loopId = null; (maybe within top-level scope). Maybe also a variable lastTime.

- Define function startLoop(){ if (loopId !== null) cancelAnimationFrame(loopId); function tick(now){ try { const dt = Math.min((now - lastTime) / 1000, 0.1); lastTime = now; update(dt); render(); } catch(e){ console.error('loop error', e); } loopId = requestAnimationFrame(tick); } loopId = requestAnimationFrame(tick); }

Also define function update(dt) {} and render() {} if not defined.

